  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "Eine umfassende Trainingsumgebung, die auf Fortschritt und Leistung ausgerichtet ist.\r\nRaum für Krafttraining, Cardio- und Cross-Training. Gruppenkurse Videos: studio athletic, studio bike, studio bench\r\nParks mit hoher Intensität."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Complete training environment, designed for progression and performance.\r\nBodybuilding area, cardio training and cross training. Group classes videos: studio athletic, studio bike, studio bench\r\nParks at high intensity.."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Un ambiente di allenamento completo, progettato per ottenere progressi e prestazioni.\r\nAllenamento con i pesi, allenamento cardio e cross training. Corsi di gruppo video: studio atletico, studio bike, studio panca, ecc\r\nParchi ad alta intensità."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Environnement d’entraînement complet, pensé pour la progression et la performance.\r\nEspace musculation, cardio training et cross training. Cours collectifs vidéos : studio athletic, studio bike, studio bench\r\nParks à haute intensité.."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Volledige trainingsomgeving, ontworpen voor vooruitgang en prestaties.\r\nBodybuilding gebied, cardiotraining en crosstraining. Groepslessen video's: studio atletisch, studiofiets, studiobank\r\nParken met hoge intensiteit .."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Un entorno de entrenamiento completo, diseñado para el progreso y el rendimiento.\r\nEntrenamiento con pesas, entrenamiento cardiovascular y entrenamiento cruzado. Clases colectivas de vídeo: estudio de atletismo, estudio de bicicleta, estudio de banco, etc\r\nParques de alta intensidad."
    ]
  },
